d-atlas/kansas/thomas-county"],["ARC or PLC in Thomas County","/arc-plc/kansas/thomas-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the Thomas County record runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids, February to March and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 40 of those years. In 2026 so far, March to April came in at 16% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 22917 had its driest year in 1956, at 43% of normal.</p>"}
